  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Update/UpdateRange (entity and DTO forms) no longer throw \"another instance with the same key value is already being tracked\" when the row was loaded earlier in the same context: the stale unchanged/modified copy is detached and the incoming instance attached. IgnoreUpdateProperty now stamps and preserves audit columns like every other update instead of writing null CreatedBy/CreatedDate. Ships version-matched agent guidance and generates .agents/skills/muslim-genericrepository during normal consuming builds; preserves user files and supports MuslimGenericRepositoryGenerateSkill=false. See CHANGELOG.md and README.md.",
